{# Illustrated explanation of a photovoltaic installation (schematic, not to scale). #}
<figure class="solar-diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 170" role="img" aria-labelledby="solar-diagram-title">
        <title id="solar-diagram-title">Soleil, panneaux photovoltaïques, onduleur, puis tableau électrique de la maison</title>
        <defs>
            <linearGradient id="flowDC" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#F2B705"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FF8A3D"/></linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <g class="solar-diagram__flow">
            <path d="M88 80 H180" stroke="#F2B705" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 8" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M262 80 H352" stroke="url(#flowDC)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 8" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M434 80 H524" stroke="#3FA9F5" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 8" fill="none"/>
        </g>
        <g transform="translate(55 80)"><circle r="26" fill="#F2B705"/><g stroke="#F2B705" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M0-40v-8M0 40v8M-40 0h-8M40 0h8M-28-28l-6-6M28 28l6 6M-28 28l-6 6M28-28l6-6"/></g></g>
        <g transform="translate(186 50)"><rect width="70" height="56" rx="6" fill="#1a2742"/><path d="M23 0v56M47 0v56M0 19h70M0 37h70" stroke="#5c7bb5" stroke-width="1.5"/></g>
        <g transform="translate(358 48)"><rect width="70" height="64" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#0D1B3D" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M16 26c6-10 12 10 18 0s12 10 18 0" stroke="#0D1B3D" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none"/><path d="M16 44h38" stroke="#0D1B3D" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/></g>
        <g transform="translate(530 40)"><path d="M0 34 40 6l40 28v52H0Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#0D1B3D" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="30" y="52" width="20" height="34" fill="#F2B705"/></g>
        <g class="solar-diagram__labels" font-family="Manrope, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#0D1B3D" text-anchor="middle">
            <text x="55" y="150">Soleil</text>
            <text x="221" y="150">Panneaux</text>
            <text x="393" y="150">Onduleur</text>
            <text x="570" y="150">Maison</text>
        </g>
        <g font-family="Manrope, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#5d6375" text-anchor="middle">
            <text x="134" y="68">lumière</text>
            <text x="307" y="68">courant continu</text>
            <text x="479" y="68">courant alternatif</text>
        </g>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>Schéma de principe : la production n’a lieu qu’en présence de lumière. Le stockage nécessite une batterie, qui n’est pas représentée ici.</figcaption>
</figure>
